        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<ol>\r\n\t<li>I'm playing as Serpent and I play <a href=\"https://sick.oberien.de/imgs/powers/unrelenting_growth.webp\">Unrelenting Growth</a> on myself. One of the presence I lay uncovers an any on my track. Can I use that any to meet the elemental threshold for Unrelenting Growth?</li>\r\n\t<li>My event card for the turn includes Stricken (Invaders do not ravage in lands with disease/strife). The fear cards instructs me to add a strife to a land, and I add one to a land that would be ravaging (ie, the right land type and did not already have strife or disease). Does it ravage (because it didn't have a strife when the event card activated) or does it not ravage (because it has a strife when the Ravage comes around)?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks!&nbsp;</p>",
